---
title: Blog
description: "Thoughts, write-ups, and notes by Anatolij Vasilev (tolik518)."
keywords: "blog, tolik518, software, rust, retro computing, cybersec, web security"
permalink: /blog/
layout: layout.njk
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<h1 style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 2rem;">Blog</h1>

{% set posts = collections.blog | sort(true, false, "date") %}

{% if posts.length == 0 %}
  <p style="text-align: center;">No posts yet. Check back soon.</p>
{% else %}
  <section class="blog-feed">
  {% for post in posts %}
    <article class="blog-entry">
      <div class="title-box">
        <h2 class="blog-entry-title"><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
        <div class="year">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="tile-content blog-post-content">
        {{ post.content | truncateHtml(1100) | safe }}
        <a class="source-code" href="{{ post.url }}">Read Post →</a>
      </div>
    </article>
  {% endfor %}
  </section>
{% endif %}

<p style="margin-top: 1rem; text-align: right;">
  <a href="/blog/feed.xml">RSS Feed</a>
</p>
